msgstr "Día y hora"

#. module: website_sale_installation_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_installation_appointment.field_delivery_carrier__installation_appointment_type_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_installation_appointment.field_sale_order__installation_appointment_type_id
msgid ""
"If set, this delivery method includes an installation: the customer must "
"schedule a date and time (and upload photos of the installation site) before"
" paying. Leave empty for regular delivery methods."
msgstr "Si se define, este método de envío incluye instalación: el cliente tiene que agendar día y hora (y subir fotos del lugar) antes de pagar. Dejalo vacío en los métodos de envío normales."

#. module: website_sale_installation_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_installation_appointment.field_sale_order__installation_required
msgid ""
"Indicates if the selected delivery method includes an installation to be "
"scheduled."
msgstr "Indica si el método de envío elegido incluye una instalación a agendar."

#. module: website_sale_installation_appointment
#: model:website.checkout.step,name:website_sale_installation_appointment.checkout_step_installation
