#. module: website_sale_installation_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_installation_appointment.field_delivery_carrier__installation_min_photos
msgid ""
"Minimum amount of photos of the installation site the customer must upload "
"before paying. Set to 0 to make photos optional."
msgstr "Cantidad mínima de fotos del lugar de instalación que el cliente tiene que subir antes de pagar. Poné 0 para que las fotos sean opcionales."

#. module: website_sale_installation_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_sale_installation_appointment.field_sale_order__installation_booking_id
